# Figma Design System Rules — tomazinmasatrip

## Design Tokens

All design tokens are defined in `src/styles/tokens.css`. **IMPORTANT: Never hardcode colors—always use CSS variables.**

### Colors (from Figma 1:3782)

| Token                             | Value          | Usage                        |
| --------------------------------- | -------------- | ---------------------------- |
| `--primary-base`                  | #e63b2e        | Accent, links, active states |
| `--primary-100` … `--primary-700` | See tokens.css | Primary scale                |
| `--secondary-100`                 | #faf7f2        | Page background              |
| `--secondary-700`                 | #221e17        | Footer, dark surfaces        |
| `--grey-100` … `--grey-700`       | See tokens.css | Text, borders, placeholders  |
| `--black`                         | #1d1919        | Headings, primary text       |
| `--white`                         | #ffffff        | Light surfaces               |

### Accent States (video cards, featured)

- Active/featured background: `rgba(230, 59, 46, 0.05)`
- Active/featured border: `rgba(230, 59, 46, 0.15)`
- Hover background: `rgba(230, 59, 46, 0.03)`

### Typography

- **Body**: `var(--font-primary)` (Poppins), 15px base, line-height 1.6
- **Headings**: `var(--font-display)` (Playfair Display)
- **Section labels**: 11px, Semibold, letter-spacing 2.2px, `var(--primary-base)`
- **Card titles**: 13px, Semibold (Poppins)
- **Meta text**: 11px, Medium, `var(--grey-300)`

### Spacing & Radius

- Grid gap: 21px
- Card gap: 14px
- Card border-radius: 12.75px
- Thumbnail border-radius: 8.75px
- Play button: circular (999px radius)

