## Vlogi Page Specifics (Figma 5:580)

- **Layout**: Single column; featured video at top, then "Vsi videi" heading, then 2-column grid
- **Featured**: Large 16:9 video in accent container; title (Playfair 21px) + date (13px grey) below
- **Video cards**: Thumb ~179×118px (or flexible), horizontal layout; title 13px Semibold; date 11px
- **Responsive**: Stack to 1 column below ~900px
